# QuailFS Bootstrap Nodes
#
# Enter one libp2p multiaddress per line.
#
# Format:
# /ip4/<IP>/tcp/<PORT>/p2p/<PEER_ID>
#
# Example:
# /ip4/203.0.113.10/tcp/4001/p2p/12D3KooWExamplePeerID
#
# You can specify multiple bootstrap nodes.
#
# Lines beginning with '#' are comments.
# Empty lines and comments are ignored.
